{"steam_appid":2961880,"steam_name":"Grocery Store Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2961880/788370/b13fa7bce37b927cd7705f505a9ecb018105b841/1750822319/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1732196378","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257075050/ab0c8bbdbea4f2bebf507d7ecec07599bca6f38b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1732196378","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/6f3be3d527ec004cfc527f8603f0fc4aa0481ada/ss_6f3be3d527ec004cfc527f8603f0fc4aa0481ada.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783883017","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/17aaced254f8f9653f372c463ffb6074ad5335c7/ss_17aaced254f8f9653f372c463ffb6074ad5335c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783883017","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/ae72759e05d095cc7df6b949a5a2b76942d34ba0/ss_ae72759e05d095cc7df6b949a5a2b76942d34ba0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783883017","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/0d1bc95860807cb35cf16d3c4d0291b4a294c818/ss_0d1bc95860807cb35cf16d3c4d0291b4a294c818.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783883017","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/ss_4cff9321caa694554997be5b0cea516d64ba7d87.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783883017"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Grocery Store Simulator you take on the role of a grocery store manager. It's a first-person game where you handle every aspect of running a grocery business. From working the checkout to managing stock in the warehouse, each choice you make affects your store’s success. Play by yourself or with friends in online co-op mode to expand your store and improve your management skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/1aa9f85f85b578af0df0b8c06a5274fe.avif?t=1783883017\" width=618 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your store equipment anywhere you want, check out customer items, make sure your pricing is right, and keep shelves stocked to keep customers happy. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/1dda61bfec3a36ae97abffd544a79192.poster.avif?t=1783883017\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/1dda61bfec3a36ae97abffd544a79192.webm?t=1783883017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/1dda61bfec3a36ae97abffd544a79192.mp4?t=1783883017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/e006f45b43bcaa7c34a475b74a8113d8.avif?t=1783883017\" width=618 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends online in a 4 player co-op mode to run your store together, sharing tasks and strategies to boost profits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/6739f483a6a623eeb05bfbcb831029fc.poster.avif?t=1783883017\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/6739f483a6a623eeb05bfbcb831029fc.webm?t=1783883017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/6739f483a6a623eeb05bfbcb831029fc.mp4?t=1783883017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/f91144be5889350a27ac3a9bcb919af1.avif?t=1783883017\" width=618 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order new products, manage deliveries, and keep your warehouse organized to efficiently use the limited space and meet the daily needs of your store. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/79bb26cc5a2551897b03d4f6fccde66d.poster.avif?t=1783883017\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/79bb26cc5a2551897b03d4f6fccde66d.webm?t=1783883017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/79bb26cc5a2551897b03d4f6fccde66d.mp4?t=1783883017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/46459d0bdd783005e91d0273093ec584.avif?t=1783883017\" width=618 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your store with any wallpaper you choose and give it a unique and memorable name. You can also decorate your store however you want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/aaa1669868147e05e46e2b0384b0349a.poster.avif?t=1783883017\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/aaa1669868147e05e46e2b0384b0349a.webm?t=1783883017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961880/extras/aaa1669868147e05e46e2b0384b0349a.mp4?t=1783883017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce® GT 730 2GB or AMD Radeon™ HD 7850 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce® GTX 1060 3GB or AMD Radeon™ RX 580 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["EXPERIMENT ONE"],"publishers":["EXPERIMENT ONE"],"release_date":"21 Nov, 2024"}